From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: Take Linux 7.2.12's display drivers

Linux 6.18 carries an older version of the H616 DE33 series than the one
7.2 merged, and LibreELEC's display series (YUV and AFBC planes, plane
scalers, YUV 4:2:0 and 10-bit HDMI, the TV encoder) is written on 7.2's.
Take 7.2.12's drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i, drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys,
ccu-sun8i-de2.c, sun50i-iommu.c and include/drm/bridge/dw_hdmi.h as they
are, so that series applies to both kernels unchanged.

